WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:07.444
Castvoo runs on a prepaid wallet, in US dollars.

2
00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:11.807
Your plan is paid from it, so there are no surprise card charges.

3
00:00:12.105 --> 00:00:15.389
Tap Top up, and pick an amount, or type your own.

4
00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:17.672
The minimum is ten dollars.

5
00:00:17.973 --> 00:00:20.820
Payment methods depend on your country.

6
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:25.375
In Nigeria, that's Paystack, for card, bank transfer or USSD.

7
00:00:25.677 --> 00:00:28.897
Everyone can also pay with USDT or Bitcoin.

8
00:00:29.197 --> 00:00:31.814
You see the local amount before you pay.

9
00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:35.852
The dollars land in your wallet once the payment is confirmed.

10
00:00:36.154 --> 00:00:43.246
Your plan card shows what you're using this month: join requests, connections, subscribers, AI writes and seats.

11
00:00:43.546 --> 00:00:46.985
Tap Choose a plan to pick Starter, Growth or Scale.

12
00:00:47.115 --> 00:00:50.281
Pay monthly, or yearly and get two months free.

13
00:00:50.581 --> 00:00:52.612
There's also a Free plan.

14
00:00:52.742 --> 00:01:00.890
One channel or group with its own welcome bot, auto-approve, one welcome message, and 500 join requests a month.

15
00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.762
No card needed.

16
00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:07.775
If your trial or plan ends and the wallet is short, nothing is deleted.

17
00:01:07.905 --> 00:01:13.136
You move to the Free plan, and your first live Welcome Flow keeps welcoming people.

18
00:01:13.436 --> 00:01:17.920
Top up again any time, and your paid plan starts again by itself.
